.TH ACTION_AXIS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_axis \- \-1..1 from a pair of actions: \-1 while neg is down, +1 while pos is down, or the analog stick value if the actions have axes bound
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "float action_axis(const ActionMap *m, const Input *in, int neg, int pos);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\-1..1 from a pair of actions: \-1 while neg is down, +1 while pos is down, or the analog stick value if the actions have axes bound. Normalize the resulting vector before scaling by speed so diagonals are not faster.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_down (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
